From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erik Bourget <erik@ebourget.net>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 01:05:07 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: usb: apple,sn201202x: Allow wakeup-source

As on ti,tps6598x, the controller may wake the system from sleep for a
change on its port.

Signed-off-by: Erik Bourget <erik@ebourget.net>
(cherry picked from commit c556b0049594207a953474b8c4810da520496239)
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/apple,sn201202x.yaml | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/apple,sn201202x.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/apple,sn201202x.yaml
index 88ee208e10..c2d2eb1068 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/apple,sn201202x.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/apple,sn201202x.yaml
@@ -39,6 +39,8 @@ properties:
     minItems: 3
     maxItems: 4
 
+  wakeup-source: true
+
   connector:
     $ref: /schemas/connector/usb-connector.yaml#
 
